1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:01,835
Could I have your attention everyone?

2
00:00:02,500 --> 00:00:12,600
An emergency situation has occurred on the tenth floor, and I ask everyone at this time to leave what you are doing and proceed toward the nearest exit out of the building.

3
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:21,255
This situation does not pose any immediate danger, but as a safety precaution, we are asking everyone to evacuate the building.

4
00:00:21,940 --> 00:00:27,140
So, please do not panic, but walk calmly to the nearest staircase out of the building.

5
00:00:27,940 --> 00:00:29,740
Please do not take the elevators.

6
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:36,515
Now, once you are outside, please make sure all the members of your department have arrived safely.

7
00:00:37,415 --> 00:00:43,380
If by any chance anyone is missing, please report the missing person to your immediate supervisors.

8
00:00:44,220 --> 00:00:48,775
Thank you, and we will let you know the progress of the situation as it occurs.
